\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar edges higher - market sentiment still weak.  \b0\par\par\uc2 611 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 2003\par 00:20\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par     By Gertrude Chavez\par     NEW YORK, Sept 10 (Reuters) - The dollar edged higher\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 against some major counterparts on Wednesday, but market  \f28 \par \par \uc2 sentiment stayed bearish, with investors unsure that the U.S.  \par \par \uc2 economic rebound is on a sustainable path.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts attributed the greenback's advance earlier in the  \par \par \uc2 session to profit-taking on the euro and the single European  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's failure to breach key technical resistance.  \par \par \uc2 "The dollar's bias is still negative," said Alex Beuzelin,  \par \par \uc2 senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Ruesch International in  \par \par \uc2 Washington, DC. He said the dollar's gains in the morning were  \par \par \uc2 just profit-taking on the euro and a minor technical correction  \par \par \uc2 after the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to breach $1.1240.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Breaching that resistance would have opened the way for\par further upside gains.\par     The euro declined to $1.1203        against the dollar,\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 down 0.2 percent, after trading below $1.12 earlier. Against  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the yen, the single European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rose to 131.19 yen  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 , up 0.05 percent.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Traders said the euro also got a minor lift after European  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  President Wim Duisenberg said euro zone interest  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rates are appropriate at 2 percent - indicating no rate cuts  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 are expected in the foreseeable future. Inflation, meanwhile,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 is on target, also at 2 percent.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 FOCUS SHIFTS TO TWIN DEFICITS  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Analysts say the market is also mulling the longer-term  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 impact of the rising U.S. current account and budget deficits,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 which after U.S. President George W. Bush on Sunday asked  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Congress for an additional $87 billion, will likely exceed $500  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 billion.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The U.S. current account deficit -- a broad measure of\par global trade -- stands at 5 percent of gross domestic product.\par     "In the last 10 days or so, the feeling that the economy\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 was doing better than thought and helped drive the dollar  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 higher has shifted, especially after Mr. Bush's speech on the  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 costs for Iraq, to paying more attention to deficit issues  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rather than growth strategies," said John McCarthy, director of  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at ING Capital Markets in New York.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We are going to have to get some awfully good economic  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 data to grow our way out of these deficits. Otherwise I think  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 you will start to see this twin deficit story exert more  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 pressure on the dollar," he added.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Against the Swiss franc, the dollar was trading higher at  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1.3839 francs , up 0.45 percent. Sterling, meanwhile, was  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 trading up 0.08 percent against the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at $1.5926  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BOJ \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  IN DOLLAR, EURO?  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar, meanwhile, held its gains against the yen, up  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0.2 percent at 117.07 yen , on suspicions the Bank of  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market in the morning,  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 traders said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We suspect there has been pretty much BoJ \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 this morning at 116.20 yen, with some buying from Japanese  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 agency banks," said Kathy Lien, chief fundamental strategist at  \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Capital Markets in New York.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     BoJ representatives in New York were unavailable to\par comment.\par     Lien also said the BoJ may have also been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 trades of the euro against the yen. "This morning at around  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 9:00 a.m. EDT, the euro rose from 130.50 yen to 131.10 yen in  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 the space of an hour. There's probably BoJ \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  there,"  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 she said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Persistent upward pressure on the yen, which has driven  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 much of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's yen-weakening \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  efforts, grew  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 further on Wednesday after data showed \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  growing at its  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 fastest pace in two and a half years in the second quarter, at  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 1 percent.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     The number was revised from the preliminary 0.6 percent\par reading.\par     (Additional reporting by Daniel Bases).\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020030910dz9a003p2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
