\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-U.S. turns up heat on Asia over  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  rates.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Alan Wheatley and Glenn Somerville  \par \uc2 768 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 September 2003\par 08:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 PHUKET, Thailand, Sept 5 (Reuters) - U.S. Treasury Secretary John Snow hammered home on Friday the need for Asian governments to keep their hands off their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and let markets decide their value, ending his week in the region as he began it.  \par \par \uc2 Snow's tough message reflects the political threat to President George W. Bush in the run-up to the November 2004 election from the loss of thousands of manufacturing jobs, blamed by Washington on what it sees as unfairly cheap Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The U.S. treasury chief pointed to a communique issued at the close of a two-day meeting of 21 regional finance ministers as evidence of progress in his campaign to persuade Asia to allow its \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise.  \par \par \uc2 "Our agreement that flexible exchange rates are necessary to promote orderly and balanced external adjustments is significant," Snow said in prepared remarks for a closing news conference of the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) forum.  \par \par \uc2 "This principle is an essential first step toward the universal acceptance of market-based, freely floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Snow said. "We should move quickly to build upon this initial foundation of agreement."  \par \par \uc2 Yet diplomats said the APEC statement was more of a draw than a victory for Washington. China, the main target of Snow's pressure, took heart from an accompanying reference in the communique to "appropriate" exchange rate policies - code for endorsement of China's semi-fixed exchange rate.  \par \par \uc2 "I believe this is a correct assessment," Jiwei Lou, China's vice-finance minister, told the news conference.  \par \par \uc2 RUNNING OUT OF PATIENCE  \par \par \uc2 At talks in Beijing earlier this week, Chinese leaders reaffirmed their long-standing commitment to relax their grip on the exchange rate when the time was ripe - but not yet.  \par \par \uc2 With the election looming large, this seems to be not good enough for Bush.  \par \par \uc2 In a CNBC interview, Bush said Snow used the Beijing meetings to "deliver a strong message from the administration that we expect our trading partners to treat our people fairly - our producers and workers and farmers and manufacturers - and we don't think we're being treated fairly when a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is controlled by the government".  \par \par \uc2 U.S. patience with Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies also seems to be wearing thin. Washington has turned a blind eye in recent months to record \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Tokyo aimed at encouraging a recovery in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's export-dependent economy and helping the re-election chances of Prime Minister Junichiro Koizumi. The Japanese leader is a Bush ally who has supported U.S. policy on Iraq and North Korea.  \par \par \uc2 But Canadian Finance Minister John Manley told Reuters that Snow would be keen to discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy at this month's meeting of leading industrialised countries in Dubai.  \par \par \uc2 "I think he'll want to talk about the Japanese. We know that one of the purposes of his trip to Japan was to include some discussion on that," said Manley, who is also on the southern Thai resort island of Phuket.  \par \par \uc2 RECORD \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Dealers reported determined \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday to prevent the yen from approaching the key level of 115 to the dollar. The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has spent nearly $80 billion this year, a record, to brake the yen's rise.  \par \par \uc2 Manley's comments pushed the yen higher in late morning trade but gains were capped on concern that the Japanese would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose too far. At 0615 GMT the dollar was at 116.82 yen.  \par \par \uc2 "We continually turn back to the idea that nobody can really devalue their way to prosperity," Snow said on Friday without naming a specific country.  \par \par \uc2 Japan's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, declined to comment on Friday on whether authorities had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market a day earlier, saying only that the government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy was unchanged.  \par \par \uc2 "I have no comment, but there is no change to our stance," Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 Asia has a mix of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regimes. China and Malaysia peg their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar, while some others like \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  float their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  but \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  periodically to prevent destabilising lurches.  \par \par \uc2 The dispute over the yuan is not expected to result in trade sanctions, partly because more than half of China's exports come from foreign firms operating there to take advantage of cheap labour to produce everything from computer keyboards to toys. (Additional reporting by Vithoon Amorn and Daiki Iga).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020030905dz95001cp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
