HF100M loss)\par Consensus sales: CHF930M (CHF10.9B)\par Note: Loss before interest and taxes seen diminishing to CHF26M from\par CHF87M. Analysts say worst seems to be over on operating level, but\par possibility of further restructuring charges a concern. Update on real\par estate sales sought.\par Macro 4 (U.MAO): FY Earnings\par Note: The company said in Jul that it expects to report a pretax profit\par before amortisation and exceptionals between GBP1.5M - GBP1.85M.\par Harrier Group (U.HRR): 1H Earnings\par Note: The oompany said in Jul that H1 trading had improved and that it\par expects to report a small post tax profit.\par SHL Group (U.SHL): 1H Earnings\par Note: The company said in Jun that it expects 1H revenue to drop 5% on\par the year earlier. The company also said 1H earnings would be only\par slightly above H2 of 2002.\par Tullow Oil (U.TLW): 1H Earnings\par Ahold (N.AHL): General shareholder meeting\par Heijmans (N.HIJ): 1H Earnings\par Kas Bank (N.KAS): 1H Earnings\par Amlin (U.AMN): 1H Earnings\par ASK Central (U.AKC): 1H Earnings\par Axis-Shield (U.ASD): 1H Earnings\par Belgravium Technologies (U.BVM): 1H Earnings\par Biotrace International (U.BIO): 1H Earnings\par Carlco (): AGM\par Davis Service Group (U.DSG): 1H Earnings\par Easynet Group (U.ESY): 1H Earnings\par Estates & General (U.EPT): 1H Earnings\par Mowlem (U.MWL): 1H Earnings\par Intertek (U.ITT): 1H Earnings\par Note: 1H EBITDA before exceptional items seen -1.9% to GBP37M from year\par ago's GBP37.7M, according to average estimate of 7 analysts surveyed by\par the company. Impact of weak USD seen substantial through all parts of\par business, particularly notable in Asia and Africa.\par MTL Instruments Group (U.MTI): 1H Earnings\par Rathbine Trousers (): 1H Earnings\par GBL (B.GBL): 1H Earnings\par Cap Gemini (F.CEY): 1H Earnings\par Note: 1H EBIT expected EUR87.5M, compared with EUR10M last year,\par according to a consensus of three analysts polled by Dow Jones\par Newswires. 1H EP